:: \ Idiot {"position":"500,500","size":"100,100"}
IDIOT... YOURE A STAR.. AGAIN?!?!? HELLO???

Or are you...

[[Um... No choice..? I guess I'll choose this... -> Nothing]]


:: \ Nothing {"position":"500,375","size":"100,100"}
Idiot!! You can't choose where you drift, you're a dam star!!
"Where the wind goes, I go" you tell yourslf.. AGAIN IDIOT, YOURE A STAR THERE IS NO WIND

You drift towards it anyways... as you come closer... your vision focuses and sees more...
It's.... it's.........
A very blue and cloudy sk- wait a second... aren't you a star?!?! I might be the idiot...

[[Keep going to the sky -> Idiot]]
[[Move in the opposite direction -> Idiot]]
[[I can't do anything, I'm not stupid, I'm a star- or am I..? -> Smart]]


:: \ Smart {"position":"625,500","size":"100,100"}
Ok fine, I'll give you some credit since you're a sta- wait... what's that...

You see a cloud... it looks like an ECS Lab Circuit Board 💔💔 bruh what you day dreaming about, it's just a rectangle with bumps 💔💔
Wait... a cloud tho?-

Turns out... you're not a star... we were idiots from the start... yes, we; you were always part of this, idiot.

You 'open' your (already opened?) eyes... and... ye, it was all a dream, I knew that idiot. I don't know how you didn't. This whole start is stupid, honestly.

[[The Beginning]]  


